  "title": "Chou Henshin Cosprayers",
  "justification": "Each AniDB episode holds two TVDB half-episodes, named in its double title: AniDB 1 \"Red Impact / Rebirth of the Dark\" is TVDB season 1 episodes 1 and 2, AniDB 2 \"Purple Beam / The Clear-Headed Green\" episodes 3 and 4, and so on to AniDB 8 \"Flaming Wills / Virgins in Shining White\" = 15 \"Flaming Wills\" and 16 \"In Shining White\". The specials split the same way: S2 \"Defeat of Red / The Hot Spring in Paradise\" = season 0 episodes 1 and 2 (2004-03-17), S3 \"Horrible Green / Violet Has Slept\" = 3 and 4, S4 \"Movie Trap / Dream Carnival\" = 5 and 6, and S1 \"Cosprayers The Movie\" = 7 \"Cosprayers The Movie\" (2004-04-28). By default AniDB k fell on TVDB k alone, so episodes 2-8 and S1 and S4 sat on the wrong halves.",
